    "On the device, open Maintenance → AIO NAV config, set output_udp to this iPhone's address and the 0x04 port, then restart AIO NAV. output_udp has only one destination, so the iPhone then replaces any other receiver.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在裝置的 Maintenance → AIO NAV config 把 output_udp 設成這支 iPhone 的位址與 0x04 埠，存檔後重啟 AIO NAV。output_udp 只有一個目的地，設定後 iPhone 會取代原本的接收端。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
