    "UDP has no authentication: anyone who can reach this port can fake READY. Enter the device's IP so packets from other sources are only counted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "UDP 沒有驗證，任何能送到這個埠的人都能偽造 READY。請填入裝置的 IP，其他來源的封包只計數、不處理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
